{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_title", "source_sha256": "2e7241130131c58eb63a769000ffcfa2dcd31a5295b80ba8000858b1c055e57a", "ja": "風花とおでかけ2", "zh": "和风花外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6ee192e44eee40769034593fa22a4f487cd3d318b126aeda16ad404a22b38192", "ja": "風花とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与风花出门外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "72e226fa6044154e1f902f1d8275b7bc14391690a4993aff4ab681b32f086fa5", "ja": "突然だけど……風花。どうやら俺達は、\n異世界の砂漠に迷い込んでしまったらしい……。", "zh": "虽然很突然……风花。看来我们好像迷失在异世界的沙漠里了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8433f3b48e76c2904e1b08535a08b7b93926692582aa0657a736779a21f81014", "ja": "{$P$}さん、何を言ってるんですか？\nここは鳥取砂丘で、砂漠じゃありませんよ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你在说什么啊？\n这里是鸟取沙丘，可不是沙漠哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "686d83b9f5a8a5890e49e13ae29c1cbbf510b5e7dd297922277dcac3aee43986", "ja": "いや、本当に砂漠なんだ。\nその証拠に……あそこに、ラクダがいるだろう？", "zh": "不，真的就是沙漠。\n证据就是……你看，那边不是有骆驼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b9187a02ba7e0c3aa8f37302f1c84ed4877172ed3999ee0aa455c93e88ed460", "ja": "え……あ、あれ？　ラクダがいる……？\nじゃあ私たち、本当に……？", "zh": "诶……啊，那是？真的有骆驼……？\n那我们真的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5c74e2ccdc0e486249e4e5fc2f6241494864ab5ba869ebb0071a70bd77e9b678", "ja": "というのは、冗談で……あのラクダは、\n観光用に飼育されてるだけなんだ。", "zh": "刚才是开玩笑的……那头骆驼只是为了观光而饲养的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4912c9d0f75498027a6cdc068c59efdf391e3bab6335e7c7fb934026ea614b9c", "ja": "な……なんなんですか、もーっ！？\n{$P$}さんのイジワル！！", "zh": "什……什么嘛，真是的！？\n{$P$}先生太坏了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2bc5e2647bfbf4d303a161279db76ce4a336111fa95e09f87824c54efec24a97", "ja": "ごめん、砂丘を見たら、つい……。お詫びという\nわけじゃないけど、ラクダに乗りに行かないか？", "zh": "抱歉，看到沙丘就忍不住……。虽说不是赔礼道歉，\n不过要不要去骑骆驼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b1a5543783152daef70705eda5dae82f2e78dc8521fee1143999956353924f9e", "ja": "えっ。いいんですか……？\nじゃあせっかくだし、乗ってみようかな……？", "zh": "诶，可以吗……？\n那难得有这个机会，我就去骑骑看吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fe1973148f15d44b3be688ba2871e95a39787561eb39366d846861a179403e20", "ja": "ラクダかぁ……どんな感じなんだろう？\n{$P$}さん、早く行きましょう♪", "zh": "骆驼啊……会是什么感觉呢？\n{$P$}先生，我们快走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "062104956abec30d85344ac3c7315996d6ffadc86252598483e968544a8072e9", "ja": "（砂丘が楽しくて、つい……。それにしても、\n風花は騙されやすいかもしれないな。気をつけよう）", "zh": "（因为沙丘太好玩了，不知不觉就……不过话说回来，风花可能比较容易上当。得小心点才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
